    <description>
LightCrosshair is a lightweight, high-performance crosshair overlay for competitive gaming on Windows 10/11.

## Features
- Layered crosshair editor and 30 local original presets
- Separate settings application; always-on Core without WPF
- Per-game crosshairs, colors, bindings and optional NVIDIA FPS caps
- Local share codes and JSON files with embedded images
- Optional FPS, frametime and 1% low overlay

## Requirements
- Windows 10 or later
- .NET 10.0 Windows Desktop Runtime (required for the current framework-dependent package)

## Installation
This package downloads the official LightCrosshair 2.0.0 installer from the GitHub Release and verifies its SHA256 checksum before installation.

After installation, launch LightCrosshair from your Start Menu.
    </description>
    <summary>Lightweight gaming crosshair overlay with FPS counter and color management</summary>
    <releaseNotes>2.0.0 preparation: layered crosshairs, separate settings process and read-only migration from v1. Publication awaits final validation.</releaseNotes>
